==Battleground==
*12 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is one of the best stages to bring [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] into due to Boraphim's pushing strength. Alternatively, Angel CC units such as [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet the Maiko]], [[Ancient Egg: N110 (Rare Cat)|Farmboy Cat]], and various Ubers can be used as substitutes should you expect to reach B100 and want Ramen Cat for that stage.

